<center>Electromagnetic radiations (such as visible light) can interact among themselves and with matter, giving rise to a multitude of phenomena such as <span class="mt-color-e74c3c"><em><strong>reflection</strong></em>, <em><strong>refraction</strong></em>, <em><strong>scattering</strong></em>, <em><strong>polarization</strong></em></span>...</center>

